55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_64":251},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_38":253,"_45":57,"_40":254,"_51":255,"_60":-7,"_11":256,"_62":257},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_64":258},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_38":260,"_45":57,"_40":261,"_51":262,"_60":-7,"_11":263,"_62":264},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_64":265},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_38":267,"_45":57,"_40":268,"_51":269,"_60":-7,"_11":270,"_62":271},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_64":272},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_38":274,"_45":57,"_40":275,"_51":276,"_60":-7,"_11":277,"_62":278},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_64":279},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_38":281,"_45":57,"_40":282,"_51":283,"_60":-7,"_11":284,"_62":285},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-55/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_64":286},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_38":288,